# Cloud provider IaC (csp/) — the code IS tracked. A blanket `csp/` ignore hid
# bastion.tf and .terraform.lock.hcl from every commit while grandfathered files
# stayed tracked, so only credential/state/plan artifacts are excluded here.
csp/**/.terraform/
